    780  f0f1							; COLUBK once now) — same position, +1c (7c gate vs 6c pair), PF2 shifts
    781  f0f1							; c61→c62 (later = right half keeps OLD band even longer, thin-yellow fix
    782  f0f1							; intact). TIA latches ENABL per line: set on this setup line → ball on
    783  f0f1							; from the band's first body line; water + HUD inherit row2's value
