    816  f0fd							; title->game frames (title HUD stomps $EE, PhaseBlink hasn't run:
    817  f0fd							; measured $FF -> 255-line rows -> 681-line boot frames). Armed is
    818  f0fd							; (RowIdx == VcrBand && VcrNext != 0); with VcrBand=1 (middle band,
    819  f0fd							; specials rule 2026-10-14) row1 takes the 8-line derive and row0
