   1137  f20c							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1138  f20c							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1139  f20c							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1140  f20c							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1141  f20c							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1142  f20c							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
