   2402  f81b							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   2403  f81b							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   2404  f81b							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   2405  f81b							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   2406  f81b							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   2407  f81b							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
