   2447  f84b							; BYTE-IDENTICAL twin in bank1 (bank1.asm, same address): the `sta $1FF7`
   2448  f84b							; switches banks, so the `jmp` opcode AND its operand are fetched from bank1,
   2449  f84b							; not from here. That is the same FoldIndirect discipline every other tramp
   2450  f84b							; uses — the twin cannot be skipped or shortened.
