   3848  ffec							; HotOverlapFlag — bank3 entry tramp (A3 2026-10-19). Moved off $FE90 (bank3
   3849  ffec							; $FE93 belongs to OvShutBand's .OSline) into the 6-byte gap after
   3850  ffec							; TallyTramp. bank0 executes `sta $1FF9`; the `jmp` at +3 is fetched from
   3851  ffec							; bank3's image at $FFEF (guard: check_moth_tramp).
